@node [highrate]
@section [highrate]
@anchor{#highrate}
High-rate binary UDP stream (500 Hz by default). @strong{[restart]}:
@code{enabled}, @code{dest_addr}, @code{dest_port}, @code{coord_frame}.
@strong{[hot]}: @code{rate_hz}.

The 276-byte binary packet format is documented in
@uref{https://github.com/richcreations/imud/blob/main/spec.md,spec.md
§8}. Consumer libraries are in @code{lib/}.

@multitable @columnfractions 0.18 0.09 0.21 0.53 
@headitem 
Key
 @tab Type
