 @tab Enable the high-rate binary stream. Opt in for machine vision,
ROS2, or any consumer needing quaternion + covariance at high rate.
@item 
@code{rate_hz}
 @tab int
 @tab @code{500}
 @tab Publish rate in Hz; must be greater than zero. The MEKF runs at
the full @code{imu.odr_hz} internally; this controls how often results
