@node [capture]
@section [capture]
@anchor{#capture}
The black box: records every raw sensor sample (pre-mount,
pre-calibration --- exactly as the driver delivered it) to rotating
@code{.imucap} files. Replay with @code{imud --replay}; analyze with
@code{imud-cal characterize} / @code{fit-temp}. Roughly 25 MB/hour at
104 Hz. See
@uref{https://github.com/richcreations/imud/blob/main/docs/capture.md,capture
& replay}. @strong{[restart]}

@multitable @columnfractions 0.15 0.09 0.23 0.53 
@headitem 
Key
 @tab Type
 @tab Default
 @tab Description
@item 
@code{enabled}
 @tab bool
 @tab @code{false}
 @tab Record raw samples from both sensors.
@item 
@code{dir}
 @tab string
 @tab @code{"/var/lib/imud"}
 @tab Destination; files are @code{imud-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.imucap} (UTC).
@item 
@code{max_mb}
 @tab int
 @tab @code{256}
 @tab Rotate the file at this size. @code{0} = unlimited.
@item 
@code{max_files}
 @tab int
